# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# shorti — environment configuration
# Copy to .env and fill in your values. Never commit .env.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Required ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SHORTI_SERVER=vpn.yourcompany.com
SHORTI_USERNAME=your.username

# Password: set one of these
SHORTI_PASSWORD=your-password
# SHORTI_PASSWORD_CMD=cat /run/secrets/vpn_password

# TOTP: set one of these (priority: CMD > SECRET_CMD > SECRET)
SHORTI_TOTP_SECRET=BASE32SECRETHERE
# SHORTI_TOTP_SECRET_CMD=cat /run/secrets/totp_secret
# SHORTI_TOTP_CMD=

# ── Optional ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SHORTI_SERVERCERT=pin-sha256:XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX=
# SHORTI_REALM=employees
# SHORTI_EXTRA_ARGS=--no-dtls

# Ping this host through the tunnel to verify connectivity (recommended)
# SHORTI_PING_HOST=10.0.0.1

# ── Tuning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SHORTI_MAX_RETRIES=5
SHORTI_RETRY_DELAY=5
SHORTI_MONITOR_INTERVAL=30
